<attribute name="problem" nodeId="909f96e1">&lt;p&gt;
    The EY Learning Experience Platform (LXP) is an AI-powered platform designed to create and disseminate customized
    learning content for transformative programs. It supports a range of educational approaches, from digital-led training
    to self-paced study, and includes extensive analytics and content management features for administrators. The platform
    enhances user engagement through personalized learning paths, interactive elements and streamlined content access.
&lt;/p&gt;
